// REQUIRES: long
// P03.25 (ADR-0025, CLAUDE.md lessons): the unit analysis stays near-linear:
// 10,000 instances of one generic function with 10,000 different units. The input is generated (Inputs/gen-units-stress.py) and checked under a
// time limit; nothing nests deeper than the parser allows and no walk is
// recursive over the size of the input.
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/gen-units-stress.py inst 10000 > %t.inst.gopp
// RUN: timeout 20 %gopp check %t.inst.gopp
// The timing check is units-stress-inst-lin.long.test.
